  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdawnteammc.github.io%252fpromenade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DawnTeamMC/Promenade/refs/heads/dev/images/logo.svg\" alt=\"Promenade\" width=\"1344\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>為最新版本 Minecraft 設計的模組，為遊戲增添新的生物群系、動物、怪物、結構與更多內容。</p>\n<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdawnteammc.github.io%252fpromenade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>瀏覽維基 &raquo;</strong></a> <br><br><a href=\"https://github.com/DawnTeamMC/Promenade/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報問題</a> - <a href=\"https://github.com/DawnTeamMC/Promenade/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">請求新功能</a> <br><br><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ksTVJu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/504608980799062036?label=&color=424549&labelColor=7289da&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=DDE4EF\" alt=\"Dawn Team Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DawnTeamMC\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/DawnTeamMC?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=424549&color=424549&logo=x\" alt=\"X (前 Twitter) 追蹤\"></a> <br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpolyformproject.org%252flicenses%252fshield%252f1.0.0%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-Polyform Shield 1.0.0-green.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"授權條款 (Polyform Shield 1.0.0)\"></a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DawnTeamMC/Promenade/refs/heads/dev/images/highlight_1.png\" alt=\"新方塊\" width=\"1344\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DawnTeamMC/Promenade/refs/heads/dev/images/highlight_2.png\" alt=\"新生物\" width=\"1344\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>👾 關於此模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>5 種全新生物群系</strong></li>\n<li><strong>2 隻新動物與 2 隻新怪物</strong></li>\n<li><strong>1 座新結構</strong></li>\n<li><strong>大量新方塊與物品</strong></li>\n<li>還有更多...</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>💖 精心手工打造，充滿愛意</li>\n<li>⚙️ 設定彈性且易於調整</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🎶 原聲帶</h2>\n<p>「櫻花叢林」將收錄由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fludocrypt.crd.co%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">LudoCrypt</a> 創作的全新曲目：<strong>Brise couleur pastel</strong>！<br>歡迎前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fludocrypt.bandcamp.com%252ftrack%252fbrise-couleur-pastel\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bandcamp</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopen.spotify.com%252fintl-fr%252ftrack%252f7t97yZezsAGDBzXUHj3H0y\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spotify</a> 或 YouTube 聆聽 <strong>Brise couleur pastel</strong>：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NUTTAB_-uY0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h2>📦 下載</h2>\n<h3>必要模組</h3>\n<p>⚠ Promenade <strong>需要</strong>安裝 Fabric API：前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 下載</p>\n<h3>相容模組</h3>\n<p>Promenade 與以下模組相容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Farming for Blockheads：前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/ModdingForBlockheads/FarmingForBlockheads\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farming-for-blockheads-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 下載</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🌟 特別感謝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Monika Carpenter</strong>（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fludocrypt.crd.co%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">LudoCrypt</a>）- 音樂創作者</li>\n<li><strong>Lylian</strong>（<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LYLIVN\" rel=\"nofollow\">@LYLIVN</a>）- 音效藝術家</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>❤️ 支援</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://patreon.com/Hugman\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=Hugman&type=patrons&style=flat-square\" alt=\"Patreon 贊助者\"></a></p>\n<p>您可以透過 <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Hugman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dawn Team 模組創辦人、主要開發者兼維護者 Hugman 的 Patreon 頁面</a> 來支援 Promenade。</p>\n<p>透過贊助 Hugman，您將獲得以下權益：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>投票決定 Dawn Team 模組的下一項新功能</li>\n<li>取得 Dawn Team 模組新功能的獨家截圖</li>\n<li>優先體驗包含新功能的最新版 Dawn Team 模組 Beta 版本</li>\n<li>優先體驗 Dawn Team 即將推出的新模組</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>我們不希望將 Dawn Team 模組的任何遊戲內功能設為付費牆，因為我們認為任何 Minecraft 模組都應該永遠免費下載並能充分使用。</strong><br>透過 Patreon 贊助主要是為了幫助 Hugman 持續改進模組，並表達您對 Hugman 作品的感謝。部分捐款可能會用於支付新功能（如音樂或美術）的成本，但並非全部。</p>\n<h2>📜 授權條款</h2>\n<p>除非另有聲明（請見 <a href=\"https://github.com/DawnTeamMC/Promenade/blob/main/thirdparty/NOTICE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">第三方授權聲明</a>），本儲存庫的內容均採用 <a href=\"https://github.com/DawnTeamMC/Promenade/blob/main/LICENSE.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">Polyform Shield 1.0.0</a> 授權條款，由 <a href=\"https://github.com/Hugman76\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hugman</a> 提供。</p>\n<h2>🎮 我的其他模組</h2>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/culinaire\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DawnTeamMC/Culinaire/refs/heads/dev/images/logo.svg\" alt=\"Culinaire\" width=\"250\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artisanat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DawnTeamMC/Artisanat/refs/heads/dev/images/logo.svg\" alt=\"Artisanat\" width=\"250\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mubble\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://dawnteammc.github.io/mubble/images/header.png\" alt=\"Mubble\" width=\"250\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-ores-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://dawnteammc.github.io/universal_ores/images/header.png\" alt=\"Universal Ores\" width=\"250\"></a></div>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;text-align:center\">Promenade 僅針對 Fabric 開發，目前不支援 Forge。</p>",
